# Bay still occupied after the car left the gate: unavailable until the sensor clears  [D14]
WAITUNTIL 10
BOOK A1
WAIT 1
WAITUNTIL 200
CAMERA entry A1
WAITC 80
PASS entry
BAY 0 OCC
WAIT 5
CAMERA exit A1
WAITC 80
PASS exit
WAIT 2
EXPECT n_DURATION=1 owner=1 bookable=2
BOOK B2
WAIT 2
EXPECT n_BOOKED=2 bay_of_BOOKED=1 owner=3
BAY 0 VAC
WAIT 2
EXPECT owner=2 bookable=2
BOOK C3
WAIT 2
EXPECT n_BOOKED=3 bay_of_BOOKED=0 owner=3
